msgid "Using Qiskit to implement ideas from the multiple-systems lesson."
msgstr "استخدام Qiskit لتطبيق أفكار درس الأنظمة المتعددة."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit implementation"
msgstr "تطبيق Qiskit"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/multiple-systems/qiskit-implementation.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/multiple-systems/qiskit-implementation.ipynb\" />\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the previous lesson, we took a first look at the `Statevector` and `Operator` classes in Qiskit, and used them to simulate operations and measurements on single qubits.\n"
"In this section, we'll use these classes to explore the behavior of multiple qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"في الدرس السابق، ألقينا نظرة أولى على صنفَي `Statevector` و`Operator` في Qiskit، واستخدمناهما لمحاكاة العمليات والقياسات على كيوبت واحد.\n"
"في هذا القسم، سنستخدم هذين الصنفين لاستكشاف سلوك كيوبتات متعددة.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We'll start by importing the `Statevector` and `Operator` classes, as well as the square root function from `NumPy`.\n"
"Hereafter, generally speaking, we'll take care of all of our required imports first within each lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"سنبدأ باستيراد صنفَي `Statevector` و`Operator`، إضافةً إلى دالة الجذر التربيعي من `NumPy`.\n"
"من الآن فصاعداً، سنحرص بشكل عام على تنفيذ جميع الاستيرادات المطلوبة في بداية كل درس.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tensor products {#tensor-products}"
msgstr "حاصل الضرب التنسوري {#tensor-products}"

# doq: emptied 2026-09-05, previous translation failed check.py
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `Statevector` class has a `tensor` method, which returns the tensor product of that `Statevector` with another, given as an argument.\n"
"The argument is interpreted as the tensor factor on the right.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, below we create two state vectors representing $\\vert 0\\rangle$ and $\\vert 1\\rangle$, and use the `tensor` method to create a new vector, $\\vert \\psi\\rangle = \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle$.\n"
"Notice here that we're using the `from_label` method to define the states $\\vert 0\\rangle$ and $\\vert 1\\rangle$, rather than defining them ourselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"على سبيل المثال، ننشئ في الكود أدناه متجهَي حالة يمثلان $\\vert 0\\rangle$ و$\\vert 1\\rangle$، ونستخدم دالة `tensor` لإنشاء متجه جديد $\\vert \\psi\\rangle = \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle$.\n"
"لاحظ أننا نستخدم دالة `from_label` لتعريف الحالتين $\\vert 0\\rangle$ و$\\vert 1\\rangle$، بدلاً من تعريفهما يدوياً.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$ |01\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$ |01\\rangle$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other allowed labels include \"+\" and \"-\" for the plus and minus states, as well as \"r\" and \"l\" (short for \"right\" and \"left\") for the states\n"
msgstr "تشمل التسميات المسموح بها أيضاً \"+\" و\"-\" للحالتين الموجبة والسالبة، وكذلك \"r\" و\"l\" (اختصاراً لـ\"right\" و\"left\") للحالتين\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert {+i} \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\frac{i}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\vert {-i} \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\frac{i}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert {+i} \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\frac{i}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\vert {-i} \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\frac{i}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, \"+\", \"-\" or \"right\" and \"left\" come from the context of quantum mechanical spin, in which a component of spin may point to the left or the right in an experiment; it is not referring to the right-most or left-most qubit in systems of multiple qubits. Here's an example of the tensor product of $\\vert {+} \\rangle$ and $\\vert {-i} \\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "هنا، تأتي كلمتا \"+\" و\"-\" أو \"right\" و\"left\" من سياق الدوران الكمي (spin) في الفيزياء الكمية، حيث قد يشير مركّب الدوران إلى اليسار أو اليمين في التجربة؛ ولا يقصد بها الكيوبت الأيمن أو الأيسر في أنظمة الكيوبتات المتعددة. إليك مثالاً على حاصل الضرب التنسوري لـ$\\vert {+} \\rangle$ و$\\vert {-i} \\rangle$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\frac{1}{2} |00\\rangle- \\frac{i}{2} |01\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2} |10\\rangle- \\frac{i}{2} |11\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\frac{1}{2} |00\\rangle- \\frac{i}{2} |01\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2} |10\\rangle- \\frac{i}{2} |11\\rangle$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An alternative is to use the `^` operation for tensor products, which naturally gives the same results.\n"
msgstr "بديل آخر هو استخدام عملية `^` للضرب التنسوري، والتي تعطي بطبيعة الحال نفس النتائج.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `Operator` class also has a `tensor` method (as well as a `from_label` method), as we see in the following examples.\n"
msgstr "يمتلك الصنف `Operator` أيضاً دالة `tensor` (إضافةً إلى دالة `from_label`)، كما نرى في الأمثلة التالية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\n"
msgstr "$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}  \\\\\n"
" 0 & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0  \\\\\n"
" \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Again, like in the vector case, the `^` operation is equivalent.\n"
msgstr "وكذلك، كما في حالة المتجهات، تُكافئ عملية `^` تماماً.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compound states can be evolved using compound operations as we would expect — just like we saw for single systems in the previous lesson.\n"
"For example, the following code computes the state $(H\\otimes I)\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ for $\\vert\\phi\\rangle = \\vert + \\rangle \\otimes \\vert {-i}\\rangle$ (which was already defined above).\n"
msgstr ""
"يمكن تطوير الحالات المركّبة باستخدام عمليات مركّبة كما هو متوقع — تماماً كما رأينا في الأنظمة المفردة في الدرس السابق.\n"
"على سبيل المثال، يحسب الكود التالي الحالة $(H\\otimes I)\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ حيث $\\vert\\phi\\rangle = \\vert + \\rangle \\otimes \\vert {-i}\\rangle$ (والذي تم تعريفه أعلاه بالفعل).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |00\\rangle- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} i}{2} |01\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |00\\rangle- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} i}{2} |01\\rangle$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is some code that defines a $CX$ operation and calculates $CX \\vert\\psi\\rangle$ for $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert + \\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0 \\rangle$. To be clear, this is a $CX$ operation for which the left-hand qubit is the control and the right-hand qubit is the target. The result is the Bell state $\\vert\\phi^{+}\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "إليك كوداً يعرّف عملية $CX$ ويحسب $CX \\vert\\psi\\rangle$ للحالة $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert + \\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0 \\rangle$. للتوضيح، هذه عملية $CX$ تكون فيها الكيوبت اليسرى هي كيوبت التحكم والكيوبت اليمنى هي كيوبت الهدف. والنتيجة هي حالة بل $\\vert\\phi^{+}\\rangle$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |00\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |11\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |00\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |11\\rangle$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial measurements {#partial-measurements}"
msgstr "القياسات الجزئية {#partial-measurements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the previous lesson, we used the `measure` method to simulate a measurement of a quantum state vector.\n"
"This method returns two items: the simulated measurement result, and the new `Statevector` given this measurement.\n"
msgstr ""
"في الدرس السابق، استخدمنا دالة `measure` لمحاكاة قياس متجه الحالة الكمية.\n"
"تُعيد هذه الدالة عنصرَين: نتيجة القياس المحاكاة، والـ`Statevector` الجديدة بعد هذا القياس.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, `measure` measures all qubits in the state vector.\n"
"We can, alternatively, provide a list of integers as an argument, which causes only those qubit indices to be measured.\n"
"To demonstrate this, the code below creates the state\n"
msgstr ""
"افتراضياً، تقيس `measure` جميع الكيوبتات في متجه الحالة.\n"
"يمكننا بدلاً من ذلك تمرير قائمة من الأعداد الصحيحة كمعامل، مما يجعل القياس يشمل تلك الفهارس فقط.\n"
"لتوضيح ذلك، ينشئ الكود أدناه الحالة\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert w\\rangle = \\frac{\\vert 001\\rangle + \\vert 010\\rangle + \\vert 100\\rangle}{\\sqrt{3}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert w\\rangle = \\frac{\\vert 001\\rangle + \\vert 010\\rangle + \\vert 100\\rangle}{\\sqrt{3}}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and measures qubit number 0, which is the rightmost qubit.\n"
"(Qiskit numbers qubits starting from 0, from right to left. We'll return to this numbering convention in the next lesson.)\n"
msgstr ""
"ويقيس الكيوبت رقم 0، وهو الكيوبت الأقصى يميناً.\n"
"(يُرقّم Qiskit الكيوبتات بدءاً من 0، من اليمين إلى اليسار. سنعود إلى هذه الاتفاقية في الترقيم في الدرس القادم.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |001\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |010\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |100\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |001\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |010\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} |100\\rangle$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |010\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |100\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |010\\rangle+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} |100\\rangle$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$ |100\\rangle$$\n"
msgstr "$$ |100\\rangle$$\n"
